渺渺楚天长，血色山花哭断肠。\n谢汝慇勤苦相劝，如今倦客已还乡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":55967,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"真珠花","author":"张舜民","text":"千玑万琲照庭除，细雨斜风拂座隅。\n莫道长安贫似磬，缘阶绕砌尽真珠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":55968,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"真珠花","author":"张舜民","text":"风中的皪月中看，解作人间五月寒。\n一似汉宫梳洗了，玉珑璁压翠云冠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":55969,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绣鹤竹","author":"张舜民","text":"好客精神来万里，此君风格耸双枝。\n丹青绝笔真难得，不似佳人粉锦时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":55970,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄陆彦回同年","author":"张舜民","text":"忍从多难生华发，枉被高谈敝黑貂。\n策马又从关塞去，空将回首恋中条。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":55971,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"望子岭梅花方开用黄道韵","author":"张舜民","text":"木海亭前花似锦，岭头梅蕊怯风沙。\n正如隐者归幽谷，鹤版徵书未到家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":55972,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梨花","author":"张舜民","text":"青女朝来冷透肌，残春小雨更霏微。\n流莺怪底事来往，为掷金梭织玉衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":55973,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"移岳州去房陵道中见海棠","author":"张舜民","text":"马息山前见海棠，群仙会处锦屏张。\n天寒日晚行人绝，自落自开还自香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":55974,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登楼","author":"张舜民","text":"繁华盖尽一时间，烟雨濛濛气象闲。\n今日登临何所似，慈恩塔上望南山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":55975,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"跋范宽小景","author":"张舜民","text":"对镜传神了不殊，岘山黄落数峰孤。\n既能咫尺成千里，何必吾家十幅图。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":55976,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"道中闻蛙声","author":"张舜民","text":"一夜蛙声不暂停，近如相和远如争。\n信知不为官私事，应恨疏萤彻夜明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":55977,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酴醾","author":"张舜民","text":"冰肌雪艳映残春，燠日薰风入四邻。\n任是主人能爱惜，也?一半与游人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":55978,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"樱桃","author":"张舜民","text":"云阳初献满筠笼，黄蜡新衣色半红。\n今日岭边空对酒，偷将泪眼望秦中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":55979,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题豆馆","author":"张舜民","text":"关头日落薄衣襟，又对丛芦拥鼻吟。\n尘土十年缠马足，只凭双鬓照归心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":55980,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题狠石","author":"张舜民","text":"江北江南一道兵，匆匆据石各论情。\n功成与尔游沧海，此语当初是至诚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":55981,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题赵大年小景","author":"张舜民","text":"生长深宫不识山，骚人一见便开颜。\n分明记得经行处，青草湖边第几湾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":55982,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题赵大年奉议小景","author":"张舜民","text":"渭曲山阴到者稀，浮休一见便开眉。\n客来不必多嗟赏，自古词人是画师。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":55983,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"薄台","author":"张舜民","text":"屈曲清溪十里长，净涵天影与秋光。\n此行却在樊川尾，稻熟鱼肥柿子黄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":55984,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠山人张无惑善画山水","author":"张舜民","text":"西征已度故关山，秋雨零零路屈盘。\n受尽艰辛心不足，解程又展画图看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":55985,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠杜山人","author":"张舜民","text":"才疏性懒一微官，终日沉埋尘土间。\n安得便为归去计，共君吟咏伴君闲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":55986,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日和检法登高之作","author":"张舜民","text":"重阳何处可登临，独有条山可共寻。\n世上几人能到此，樽前万事莫相侵。\n溪风猎猎频吹帽，菊蕊纷纷易满襟。\n莫为嘉辰须索醉，也须随分惜光阴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":55987,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月十五日夜清溪舟次","author":"张舜民","text":"清溪水底月团团，因见中秋忆去年。\n旱海五更霜透甲，郴江万里桂随船。\n昔看故国光常满，今望天涯势似偏。\n只恐姮娥应笑我，还将只影对婵娟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":55988,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]